### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| location_id | Location id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | location_id |
| name | Name | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | name |
| location_type | Location type | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. Allowed values: Store, Warehouse. | location_type |
| location_type_code | Location type code | string | Stable machine code; localized display value is separate. Allowed values: store, warehouse. | location_type_code |
| organization_id | Organization id | string | Foreign key to organizations; blank creates no edge. | organization_id |

